{"sha": "e250d0e72a4c1bc3427d6addc81e4c2dc79bb264557fcf3a9ec5505dc5aca32e", "body": ["\\textbf{6.} $12.6 - 0.010 \\times 12 = \\qty{12.48}{V}$; $12.6 - 0.010 \\times", "120 = \\qty{11.40}{V}$。将 $u$ 对 $i$ 作图得一条直线，", "截距为 $E$，斜率为 $-r$（最小二乘法，见\\cref{ch:b1:units-dimensions}）。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 两盏灯：\\qty{110}{W}，\\qty{12}{V}，\\qty{9.2}{A}；", "$60/9.2 = \\qty{6.5}{h}$。能量 $60 \\times 3600 \\times 12 = \\qty{2.6}{MJ}$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $R_h = 12^2/55 = \\qty{2.62}{\\ohm}$；并联后为 \\qty{1.31}{\\ohm}。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $i = 12.6/0.090 = \\qty{140}{A}$; $u = 12.6 - 1.4 = \\qty{11.2}{V}$;", "$P_s = 0.080 \\times 140^2 = \\qty{1.57}{kW}$；损耗 $0.010 \\times 140^2 =", "\\qty{196}{W}$.", "", "\\textbf{10.} $R = 0.080 \\parallel 1.31 = \\qty{75.4}{m\\ohm}$; $i = 12.6/0.0854", "= \\qty{148}{A}$; $u = 12.6 - 1.48 = \\qty{11.1}{V}$.", "", "\\textbf{11.} $i_s = i \\times 1.31/(1.31 + 0.080) = \\qty{139}{A}$; $i_h =", "\\qty{8.5}{A}$，为两盏灯的电流。", "", "\\textbf{12.} 每盏灯：$u^2/R_h = 11.1^2/2.62 = \\qty{47}{W}$，对比", "\\qty{55}{W}：下降 $14\\%$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 回路定律：端电压为 $u = E - ri$；起动机的", "\\qty{140}{A} 电流在电池内部产生 \\qty{1.4}{V} 的压降，", "与之并联在同一接线柱上的灯承受的就是这一降低了的", "电压。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 只能部分改善：较粗的电缆减小的是电缆上的压降，", "而不是 $r$；直接接在电池接线柱上的灯，仍承受 $E - ri$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 同一对节点之间有三条支路：$(E, r)$，", "$(E_a, r_a)$ 以及 $R_h = \\qty{1.31}{\\ohm}$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $V = \\dfrac{12.6/0.010 + 14.2/0.050 + 0/1.31}{100 + 20 + 0.763}", "= \\dfrac{1544}{120.8} = \\qty{12.79}{V}$.", "", "\\textbf{17.} 交流发电机 $(14.2 - 12.79)/0.050 = \\qty{28.3}{A}$；", "电池 $(12.6 - 12.79)/0.010 = \\qty{-18.6}{A}$（电流\\emph{流入}电池）；", "灯 $12.79/1.31 = \\qty{9.8}{A}$；$28.3 = 18.6 + 9.8$。", "", "\\textbf{18.} 充电。电池吸收 $12.79 \\times 18.6 = \\qty{238}{W}$", "（\\qty{234}{W} 储存为化学能，\\qty{3.5}{W} 转化为热量）；发电机", "在其接线柱处提供 $12.79 \\times 28.3 = \\qty{362}{W}$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 仅电池供电（发电机 $\\to$ \\qty{50}{m\\ohm}）：负载", "$0.050 \\parallel 1.31 = \\qty{48.2}{m\\ohm}$, $u_1 = 12.6 \\times 48.2/58.2 =", "\\qty{10.44}{V}$。仅发电机供电（电池 $\\to$ \\qty{10}{m\\ohm}）：负载", "$0.010 \\parallel 1.31 = \\qty{9.92}{m\\ohm}$, $u_2 = 14.2 \\times 9.92/59.9 =", "\\qty{2.35}{V}$。两者之和为 \\qty{12.79}{V}。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $u = 5.0\\,R_s/(R_0 + R_s)$：在 \\qty{20}{\\degreeCelsius} 时为 \\qty{3.60}{V}，", "在 \\qty{90}{\\degreeCelsius} 时为 \\qty{1.40}{V}。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\Delta u = 5[R_a/(R_0 + R_a) - R_b/(R_0 + R_b)]$;", "$\\dd\\Delta u/\\dd R_0 = 0 \\Leftrightarrow R_a/(R_0 + R_a)^2 = R_b/(R_0 +", "R_b)^2 \\Leftrightarrow R_0^2 = R_aR_b$: $R_0 = \\sqrt{2000 \\times 300} =", "\\qty{775}{\\ohm}$.", "", "\\textbf{22.} $u = 5[\\tfrac12 - R_s/(775 + R_s)]$，当 $R_s =", "\\qty{775}{\\ohm}$ 时为零，即", "热敏电阻达到该阻值时的量程中点温度。", "", "\\textbf{23.} $R = 1.7\\times10^{-8} \\times 1.5/16\\times10^{-6} =", "\\qty{1.6}{m\\ohm}$ 每根导体，总计 \\qty{3.2}{m\\ohm}；压降 $0.0032", "\\times 140 = \\qty{0.45}{V}$；功率 \\qty{63}{W}。", "", "\\textbf{24.} \\qty{4}{mm^2}：每根 \\qty{6.4}{m\\ohm}，\\qty{12.8}{m\\ohm}", "总计：压降 \\qty{1.8}{V}，损耗 \\qty{250}{W} --- 起动机将损失", "其电压的六分之一。粗电缆使 $R_{\\text{电缆}} \\ll R_s$。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 起动时接线柱处约为 \\qty{11.1}{V}；", "起动机获得 $1568/(1568 + 196) \\approx 89\\%$ 的电池功率；", "灯光变暗是回路定律的结果，$u = E - ri$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}